! CASSCF def2-SVP TightSCF NoAutoStart
# Valence-only SA-CASSCF for the L-edge workflow: Ti 3d manifold ONLY.
# The 2p core is deliberately NOT in this active space -- it is spliced in
# afterwards, on the PySCF side, for the CASCI step (scripts/03).
#
# ActOrbs DOrbs makes ORCA rotate the metal d-shell into the active space
# rather than taking whatever five orbitals happen to straddle the Fermi
# level (for TiCl3/def2-SVP the naive choice would grab MO 37, which is
# only 1.2% Ti 3d -- see common.print_orbital_table).
#
# def2-SVP is all-electron: no ECP, so the Ti 2p orbitals this workflow
# needs are present in the resulting .gbw.

%casscf
  nel     1
  norb    5
  mult    2
  nroots  5
  actorbs dorbs
end

* xyz 0 2
Ti          0.00102937295132      0.00000051041430     -0.44446015752021
Cl          2.19897797218127     -0.00000153882494     -0.44773700326685
Cl         -1.10000487125569      1.90237501836060     -0.44490133186414
Cl         -1.10000247387690     -1.90237398994996     -0.44490150734880
*
